        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>□ 抵押權塗銷登記</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p>□ 清償　□ 拋棄　□ 混同　□ 判決塗銷　□</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
